 "intro_zh": "岳麓山，是南岳七十二峰的尾峰，古树名木较多，有多处文物古迹、烈士名人墓葬等。岳麓山山下有被列为中国古代四大书院之一的岳麓书院，山腰有古麓山寺，山顶有云麓道宫，是儒、佛、道三教相互交融的地区。",
 "intro_en": "Orange Isle (Chinese: 橘子洲; pinyin: Júzi Zhōu) is an isle in Xiang River, Changsha, Hunan, China. It also known by other names, such as Ju Isle (橘洲; Jú Zhōu) and Shuilu Isle (水陆洲; 水陸洲; Shuǐlù Zhōu; 'Water-and-land Isle'). It has a length of 5 kilometres (3.1 mi), a width of 40 to 140 metres (130 to 460 ft) and a total area of 370,900 square metres (91.64 acres). It was also a national AAAAA (5A) level tourist attraction and a national key scenic spot.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
